{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：把同调这台机器立起来","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/homological-algebra/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-homological-algebra","title":"为何需要同调代数：给\"障碍\"一个度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/homological-algebra/foundations/why-homological-algebra","wordCount":1607,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"chain-complexes","title":"链复形与同调：同调代数的核心机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/homological-algebra/foundations/chain-complexes","wordCount":1525,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"exact-sequences","title":"正合列：追踪信息流动的日常工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/homological-algebra/foundations/exact-sequences","wordCount":1483,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础-把同调这台机器立起来\">基础：把同调这台机器立起来</h1><p>要用同调代数，得先接受一个转变视角的动作：不再直接研究一个对象，而是研究一串对象和它们之间的映射，并只关心其中&quot;该消失却没消失&quot;的部分。这一章的三篇文档，正是把这个视角和它的最小工具集立起来。</p>\n<p>第一篇回答&quot;为何要有同调代数&quot;。它不急着给定义，而是先展示同一种障碍如何在拓扑的洞、方程组的相容性、群的扩张等看似无关的地方反复出现，从而说明为什么值得把这套度量方法从各个具体领域里抽离出来单独研究。读完它，你会明白后面所有机器都在服务同一件事——量化偏离正合的程度。</p>\n<p>第二篇讲链复形与同调，这是全 hub 的核心机制。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^2=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 这个条件、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ker</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">im</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_n=\\ker d_n/\\operatorname{im} d_{n+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ker</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">im</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这个商、以及链映射与链同伦如何让不同复形之间的比较成为可能，都在这里一次讲透。之后每一章遇到&quot;取同调&quot;这个动作，都默认你已经掌握本篇。</p>\n<p>第三篇讲正合列，这是同调代数最常挥动的日常工具。短正合列、长正合列、蛇引理、五引理——它们是把一个复杂对象拆成可管理片段、并追踪信息如何在片段间流动的手段。全 hub 凡涉及正合列技巧，完整版都在此篇，其它地方只点到即止。</p>\n<p>在整个 hub 中，本章是语言与地基：函子章的导出函子建立在链复形与正合列之上，进阶章的谱序列是正合列思想的高阶推广，应用章的每一个例子最终都要落回&quot;取某个复形的同调&quot;。建议按 1→2→3 顺序读，不要跳过第二篇的链同伦部分，它是后面理解&quot;分解与选取无关&quot;的关键。</p>\n"}